### Phase 11: Kafka. Read models built from events.
### Tokens:  ./infrastructure/keycloak/pkce-login.sh <alice|bob|sam> 2>/dev/null
### Watch the events while you send these:
###   docker exec banking-kafka /opt/kafka/bin/kafka-console-consumer.sh --bootstrap-server localhost:9092 \
###     --topic banking.account-transactions --property print.key=true --property print.partition=true

@gw = http://localhost:8080
@alice = paste-alice-token
@bob = paste-bob-token
@sam = paste-sam-token
@aliceAccount = paste-an-alice-account-id
@bobsNumber = paste-a-bob-account-number
@bobId = b0b5e1c2-3d4f-4a6b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d

### 1. Deposit → event DEPOSIT (key = account ID)
POST {{gw}}/api/accounts/{{aliceAccount}}/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 500.00 }

### 2. Transfer → events TRANSFER_OUT (Alice), TRANSFER_IN (Bob), PAYMENT_COMPLETED
POST {{gw}}/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sourceAccountId": "{{aliceAccount}}", "targetAccountNumber": "{{bobsNumber}}", "amount": 75.00, "description": "kafka demo" }

### 3. Alice's statement (transaction-service, from events), newest first
GET {{gw}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}

### 4. One account only
GET {{gw}}/api/transactions?accountId={{aliceAccount}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}

### 5. Bob's statement: the incoming TRANSFER_IN
GET {{gw}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{bob}}

### 6. Bob asks for Alice's account → empty page (ownership is part of the query)
GET {{gw}}/api/transactions?accountId={{aliceAccount}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bob}}

### 7. Bob's e-mails (notification-service): "Money received"
GET {{gw}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{bob}}

### 8. Alice's e-mails: "Transfer sent"
GET {{gw}}/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}

### 9. SUPPORT: a customer's movements (back office)
GET {{gw}}/api/admin/transactions?ownerId={{bobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{sam}}

### 10. Customer on the back-office endpoint → 403
GET {{gw}}/api/admin/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{alice}}
